{"ref":"BDB, רְצִין","hw":"רְצִין","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רְצִין</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  king of Aram, Ahaz’s time: <a data-ref=\"II Kings 15:37\" href=\"/II_Kings.15.37\">2 K 15:37</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 16:5\" href=\"/II_Kings.16.5\">16:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 16:6\" href=\"/II_Kings.16.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 16:9\" href=\"/II_Kings.16.9\">9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.1\">Is 7:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.4\">4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.8\">8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 8:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.8.6\">8:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 9:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.9.10\">9:10</a>; Ρα(α)σ(σ)ων, Ρασειν.*<br><strong>2.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:48\" href=\"/Ezra.2.48\">Ezr 2:48</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:49\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.49\">Ne 7:50</a>, Ρα(α)σων.","next":"BDB, רָצַע","prev":"BDB, רִצְיָא"}